# Frontend environment variables (Vite). Copy to `.env.local` to override locally.
# `.env.local` is gitignored, so real values never reach the repository.

# Where the dashboard sends AI requests. Unset in local development: the Vite dev
# server proxies `/ai-api` to http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.js).
# When the dashboard and API are deployed separately, point this at the API origin,
# e.g. the Render/Railway URL from backend/DEPLOYMENT.md:
# VITE_AI_API_URL=https://delivery-intelligence-api.onrender.com
